      "block_id": "p-acceptance",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The v1 acceptance matrix shows 34/34 items PASS. Items #23 (CPU budget) and #32 (v1 readiness artifact) were the final gaps closed by Wave 2 Agent B. CPU budget tests validate count-based measurement, coalesce throughput, queue drain byte/count metrics, and drop enforcement at cap boundaries. The v1 readiness artifact (this document) records all schemas, implementation files, test files, proofs, and deferred seams.",
